      "zh-Hant": "出身",
      "en": "Origins"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "新德意志傳記辭典記載，布拉斯科維茨是上將，1883 年 7 月 10 日生於帕特斯瓦爾德（韋勞縣）。德國歷史博物館的線上傳記進一步寫到，他是牧師赫爾曼·布拉斯科維茨之子。",
      "en": "The Neue Deutsche Biographie records Blaskowitz as a Generaloberst born on 10 July 1883 in Paterswalde, Kreis Wehlau. The German Historical Museum's online biography adds that he was the son of the pastor Hermann Blaskowitz."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [],
     "citations": [
