      "start": "1938-01-15",
      "end": "1939-09-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "德勒斯登第三集團司令部",
      "en": "Group Command 3 in Dresden"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "新德意志傳記辭典寫到，他在 1938 年 1 月 15 日接掌德勒斯登的第三集團軍司令部。德國歷史博物館的年表同樣把 1938 年列為他出任該集團司令部統帥之年。美國陸軍的波蘭戰役研究則說明，第八軍是由布拉斯科維茨的第三集團司令部組成的。",
      "en": "The Neue Deutsche Biographie says that on 15 January 1938 he took over the command of Heeresgruppe III in Dresden. The German Historical Museum's chronology likewise places his command of Group Command 3 in Dresden in 1938. A US Army study of the Polish campaign states that Eighth Army would be formed from Blaskowitz's Group Command 3."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [],
     "citations": [
