    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {
      "start": "1939-09-01",
      "end": "1939-09-28"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "波蘭戰役中的第八軍",
      "en": "Eighth Army in the Polish campaign"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "德國歷史博物館的年表寫到，波蘭戰事開始時，布拉斯科維茨是德國第八軍的指揮官。同館關於布楚拉河戰役的頁面也說，第八軍由他統率。年表另記他在 9 月 27 日接受華沙的投降。美軍研究記述，在進攻華沙之前，第八軍指揮官布拉斯科維茨接獲了指示。",
      "en": "The German Historical Museum's chronology says that when the invasion of Poland began he was commander of the German Eighth Army. The same museum's page on the Battle of the Bzura likewise describes the Eighth Army as being under General Blaskowitz. The chronology adds that on 27 September he accepted Warsaw's capitulation. The US Army study records that the Eighth Army commander, Blaskowitz, was given instructions before the attack on Warsaw."
     },
