     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "東線總司令",
      "en": "Oberbefehlshaber Ost"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "德國歷史博物館的年表寫到，他在 10 月 20 日成為波蘭德軍佔領部隊的總司令。美國陸軍的研究則寫到，他在 10 月 19 日被任命接替倫德施泰特。新德意志傳記辭典只說他同年 10 月成為東線總司令。",
      "en": "The German Historical Museum's chronology says that on 20 October he became commander-in-chief of the German occupation forces in Poland. The US Army study states that he was appointed to succeed Rundstedt on 19 October. The Neue Deutsche Biographie says only that he became Oberbefehlshaber Ost in October of that year."
     },
